label "Thinking-budget control diagram"
box task 18 100 92 44 "task"
box alloc 140 92 118 60 "budget|allocator" acc
box low 300 40 140 44 "low effort"
box high 300 150 140 44 "high effort"
arrow task alloc
arrow alloc low
arrow alloc high
bar 300 100 40
bar 300 210 140
text 300 118 "few reasoning tokens" size=11 left
text 300 228 "many reasoning tokens" size=11 left
note "reasoning tokens are billed as output — depth is a cost decision"
